@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_LOGIN
@productId = COLE_O_ID_DO_PRODUTO
@orderId = COLE_O_ID_DO_PEDIDO

### Saúde do serviço
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Login: substitua pela senha definida no seu .env
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "local-admin-password-change-me"
}

### Cadastrar produto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "CAFE-01",
  "name": "Café torrado 500g",
  "price": 25.90
}

### Registrar entrada
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}/stock-movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "INBOUND",
  "quantity": 10,
  "reason": "Compra inicial"
}

### Reservar pedido: mantenha a chave para testar o reenvio da mesma solicitação
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 41e33cb4-5118-4e0a-b51d-9cae06c925da
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Mercado de demonstração",
  "items": [
    {"productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 2}
  ]
}

### Consultar pedido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Confirmar pedido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar um pedido que ainda esteja RESERVED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar histórico do produto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}/stock-movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar pedidos confirmados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?status=CONFIRMED&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
